                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "bbef6fd3-29f1-3874-9521-2b90c6464167",
                        "entry_id": "97d2c167-6240-31e8-b17e-b9937b70f1f2",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To unsmother; to free from suffocation or suffocating circumstances."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "61593c7e-9490-4e03-9999-69e1ff5b44ac",
                                "sense_id": "bbef6fd3-29f1-3874-9521-2b90c6464167",
                                "text": "And galvanism has set some corpses grinning, But has not answer'd like the apparatus Of the Humane Society's beginning, By which men are unsuffocated gratis:"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "611ba0eb-c517-437c-9655-a679c439cdc4",
                                "sense_id": "bbef6fd3-29f1-3874-9521-2b90c6464167",
                                "text": "But here is an honest attempt to unsuffocate the central part of the city, which was like a plumpish woman with a pair of diabolical tight corsets cutting into her waist."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e81c6b64-9c45-44fc-a725-d89da7139e84",
                                "sense_id": "bbef6fd3-29f1-3874-9521-2b90c6464167",
                                "text": "Because academics have had cause from earliest times to unsuffocate themselves, as it were, in the fields?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3656813b-6209-408a-981b-3c4d22027d12",
                                "sense_id": "bbef6fd3-29f1-3874-9521-2b90c6464167",
                                "text": "He had spent his life, it seemed, re-covering David and unsuffocating John."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
